hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2735","###\n Narrated to us by Bishr bin Mu'adh al-'Aqadi, who said: Narrated to us by Fuḍayl, meaning Ibn Sulaymān, who said: I heard 'Abdullāh bin 'Uthmān, who is Ibn Khuthaym, say: I heard Sa'īd bin Jubayr narrating from Ibn 'Abbās (RA), who said: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \"Allah will surely raise this Black Stone on the Day"
